# netsurf: claude's initial-load hang -- prototype accessors read through Reflect.get, microtask deadline, unchanged attribute writes, no-op style changes (patch 426)
# Generated 2026-11-09
# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 425)
#
# claude.ai's sign-in page stalled on its initial load (log stopped right
# after "WANTLOW __signInBooted", layout never made; 425 5/5 loads, 424
# 2/5). Diagnosed in scratch builds (doc 10): the process spun at 100% in
# ONE microtask (a SIGUSR1 backtrace preload -- ptrace_scope blocks gdb
# attach); a time-based job interrupt logged its JS stack: function Ge in
# signin-CM83ESyh.js, an ancestor walk
#     for (t = Oe(e); t !== null; t = Oe(t)) ...
#     Oe = e => Reflect.get(Node.prototype, "parentElement", e)
# Node.prototype had no parentElement accessor: Reflect.get answered
# undefined, undefined !== null, Oe(undefined) is undefined -- forever.
#
#  - vita_polyfill.js (last in the file): Node / Element / HTMLElement /
#    Document prototypes get an accessor for each of 29 standard
#    properties they have none of their own for, forwarding to the real
#    one further along the receiver's chain (every forwarder skipped:
#    two forwarders on a custom element's chain recursed; installed last:
#    the sections above add a property only where none exists, and a
#    forwarder there first made them skip Element.prototype.id /
#    localName -- the gate's CUSTOMEL caught both).
#  - macsurf_qjs.c: a microtask job runs under the timer deadline
#    (fixes586's rule): an endless job throws InternalError instead of
#    freezing the browser.
#  - Past Ge, the page re-set the same attributes on its buttons, and an
#    inline-block <span>'s empty style, every frame: ~395 full rebuilds a
#    load, the page never settled (6 of 10 loads timed out).
#    macsurf_qjs.c: setAttribute to the value already there, or
#    removeAttribute of an absent one, marks no rebuild (the
#    MutationObserver record stays, as in browsers). html.c: a style
#    attribute change on a non-inline, non-block box that leaves the
#    element's own style and pseudo styles as the box holds them changes
#    nothing (html_rl_style_unchanged).
#
# claude (scratch build): 10/10 loaded, 3-8 full rebuilds a load.
#
